  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>R</mi></math> be given by <math> <mrow> <mi>f</mi><mfenced> <mi>x</mi> </mfenced></mrow> </math> <math><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Then which of the following options is/are correct?",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "Xqxwa",
      "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&prime;</mi></math>  is NOT differentiable at  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
